        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Grandeur FAVBUR19, Clear Crystal Burgundy Knob with Fifth Avenue Tall Plate</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Fifth Avenue Tall Plate with Burgundy Knob has a lovely, scalloped shape that brings a romantic feel to this large door knobset. The Fifth Avenue Tall Plate is what makes it large. It is 11 inches tall and 2.65 inches wide, making it ideal for big doors. The Burgundy knob is made out of high-quality crystal; and the backplate is available in a wide array of finish options. The Clear Crystal Burgundy Knob with Fifth Avenue Tall Plate is available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available <a href=\"/products/burgundy-crystal-knob-with-fifth-avenue-plate-entryset-grandeur-favbur19entr\"><b>Burgundy Crystal Knob with Fifth Avenue Plate Entryset.</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Grandeur Crystal Burgundy Knob with Fifth Avenue Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</li>\r\n<li>10 Year Finish Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Burgundy Crystal Knob with Fifth Avenue Tall Plate:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Knob Material: Crystal</li>\r\n<li>Plate Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Knob Height: 2.75\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Width: 1.625\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Projection: 2.375\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Height: 11\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Width: 2.65\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Projection: .39\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Centers: 8.25\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: Adjustable 1-3/8\" to 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/GRA-FAVBUR19-specifications.pdf?v=1704262393\" target=\"new\"><b>Grandeur FAVBUR19 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting A Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> A surfaced mounted, non-working knob. Non-locking and non-latching trim for one side of door. This inactive pull is usually used to match trim.</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> Surfaced mounted, non-working knobs. Non-locking and non-latching trim for both sides of door. These inactive pulls are usually used to match trim.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> Latches but does not lock. The latch is activated by turning the either of the two knobs.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> Latches and can be locked. Can be locked from the inside with a push-button.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</li>\r\n</p>",
